gotcall_* -- the fixtures for `kuna xrefs` and `kuna decompile-graph` over a
call through an import's GOT slot (GH #1376;
decompiler/crates/kuna-cli/tests/xrefs_got_call.rs).

What they are
  gotcall_macho_arm64   arm64 Mach-O dylib from the issue's own assembly:
                        adrp x16,_malloc@GOTPAGE; ldr x16,[x16,..]; blr x16.
                        The __DATA_CONST,__got slot at 0x4000 is a chained-fixup
                        bind (DYLD_CHAINED_PTR_64) to libSystem's _malloc.
  gotcall_macho_x86_64  x86-64 Mach-O dylib: call *_malloc@GOTPCREL(%rip), and
                        the same slot loaded into rax and called.
  gotcall_aarch64       AArch64 ELF shared object: the issue's sequence against
                        an R_AARCH64_GLOB_DAT slot.
  gotcall_x86_64        x86-64 ELF shared object: the two x86-64 spellings
                        against an R_X86_64_GLOB_DAT slot.
  Sources: gotcall_macho.s, gotcall_macho_x86_64.s, gotcall_aarch64.S,
  gotcall_x86_64.S; gotcall_libSystem.tbd stands in for the macOS SDK.

Why they are vendored
  CI has no Mach-O linker and no AArch64 toolchain, and the property under test
  is the linked layout (the bound GOT slot), so the binaries are checked in.

Where they came from
  docker image mstorsjo/llvm-mingw (clang 23.1.4, LLD 23.1.4):

      clang -target arm64-apple-macos11 -c gotcall_macho.s -o m.o
      lld -flavor darwin -dylib -arch arm64 -platform_version macos 11.0 11.0 \
          -fixup_chains -install_name @rpath/gotcall.dylib \
          -o gotcall_macho_arm64 m.o gotcall_libSystem.tbd
      clang -target x86_64-apple-macos11 -c gotcall_macho_x86_64.s -o mx.o
      lld -flavor darwin -dylib -arch x86_64 -platform_version macos 11.0 11.0 \
          -fixup_chains -install_name @rpath/gotcall.dylib \
          -o gotcall_macho_x86_64 mx.o gotcall_libSystem.tbd
      clang -target aarch64-linux-gnu -c gotcall_aarch64.S -o a.o
      ld.lld -shared --build-id=none -o gotcall_aarch64 a.o
      clang -target x86_64-linux-gnu -c gotcall_x86_64.S -o x.o
      ld.lld -shared --build-id=none -o gotcall_x86_64 x.o

